# Vercel deployment ignore for Customer Storefront project (Root Directory = .)

# 1. Ignore Admin subproject and archives (Admin has its own Vercel project with Root Directory = maxora-admin)
maxora-admin/
maxora-admin.tar.gz
maxora-admin.zip

# 2. Prevent legacy duplicate wrapper files from being compiled as standalone Serverless Functions
